{'symbol': 'FI', 'date': '2019-11-04 22:30:00', 'title': "FRANK'S INTERNATIONAL N.V. REPORTS EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019", 'text': "FRANK'S INTERNATIONAL N.V. ANNOUNCED EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019. FOR THE THIRD QUARTER, THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED TOTAL REVENUE WAS USD 140.417 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 128.986 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING LOSS WAS USD 14.803 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 13.591 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET LOSS WAS USD 23.789 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 6.999 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC LOSS PER SHARE WAS USD 0.11 COMPARED TO USD 0.03 A YEAR AGO. FOR THE NINE MONTHS, TOTAL REVENUE WAS USD 440.479 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 376.640 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING LOSS WAS USD 47.611 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 72.280 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET LOSS WAS USD 67.236 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 74.835 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC LOSS PER SHARE WAS USD 0.3 COMPARED TO USD 0.33 A YEAR AGO."}